>> title: Sweet and Sour Sauce
>> category: Sauces & Gravies
>> tags: pineapple, vinegar, chinese, stir-fry, stovetop
>> servings: 6
>> time: 15 min
>> step.1: whisk
>> step.2: simmer 5 min
>> step.3: thicken 1 min

Whisk @pineapple juice{3/4%cup}(180 mL), @rice vinegar{1/3%cup}(80 mL), @sugar{1/3%cup}(70 g), @tomato ketchup{3%Tbs}, and @soy sauce{1%Tbs} together in a #small saucepan{}.

Simmer @&(~1)mixture{} with @fresh ginger{1%tsp}(grated) and @garlic{1%clove}(minced) for ~{5%min}.

Thicken @&(~1)sauce{} with @cornstarch{1%Tbs} slaked in @cold water{2%Tbs}, simmering ~{1%min} until clear and glossy.
